  ## Service Model: IaaS (Infrastructure as a Service)

  This infrastructure runs on a **Hetzner CX23 virtual machine** — a classic example of IaaS.

  | What Hetzner provides | What I manage |
  |---|---|
  | Physical servers | Operating system (Ubuntu 24.04) |
  | Network hardware | All software and services |
  | Power and cooling | Security configuration |
  | Hypervisor | Data and backups |

  This is the **Shared Responsibility Model** in practice: the cloud provider owns the hardware layer, the customer owns everything above it.

