  ## Services Running (Containerized)

  All services run in **Docker containers** — the industry standard for portable, isolated deployments.

  | Service | Role | Cloud Equivalent |
  |---|---|---|
  | n8n | Workflow automation / iPaaS | AWS Step Functions + Lambda |
  | PostgreSQL 16 | Relational database | AWS RDS |
  | Nginx Proxy Manager | Reverse proxy + SSL termination | AWS ALB (Application Load Balancer) |
  | Tailscale | Mesh VPN / private network | AWS VPC (Virtual Private Cloud) |
  | Pi-hole | DNS filtering | AWS Route 53 + DNS firewall |
  | Uptime Kuma | Monitoring and alerting | AWS CloudWatch |
  | Vaultwarden | Secrets management | AWS Secrets Manager |

