  ## Network Architecture

  Internet
      │
      ▼
  Hetzner Firewall (perimeter — allows xxxx only)
      │
      ▼
  Ubuntu UFW (host firewall — second layer)
      │
      ▼
  Nginx Proxy Manager (reverse proxy — SSL termination)
      │
      ▼
  Docker internal network (services not exposed publicly)
      │
      ├── n8n 
      ├── PostgreSQL 
      └── Other services 

  **Key principle:** Only some ports are publicly exposed. All internal services communicate over a private Docker network — equivalent to an AWS VPC with private subnets.

