  ## Availability and Disaster Recovery

  | Aspect | Current state |
  |---|---|
  | Availability zone | Single zone (Helsinki) |
  | Backup strategy | PostgreSQL pg_dump (planned) |
  | RTO (Recovery Time Objective) | ~15 min (manual redeploy) |
  | RPO (Recovery Point Objective) | Last backup |
  | Known failure mode | Docker network drops after reboot — manual fix required |
  | Hetzner backup | Active|

  **Improvement opportunity:** Multi-region redundancy would require a second VM in a different region (e.g., Hetzner Nuremberg) with database replication — equivalent to AWS Multi-AZ RDS.

